---
const email = "mailto:enrique@enriquegh.com";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Enrique Gonzalez — Support engineering & people leadership</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Hi, I’m Enrique. Ten years in support engineering, six in management. Most recently, I led a global support team at Sourcegraph."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href={Astro.site} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#faf9f6" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Hi, I’m Enrique." />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Support engineering, people leadership, and a little curiosity."
    />
    <meta property="og:url" content={Astro.site} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">
      Skip to content
    </a>
    <div class="page">
      <header>
        <a class="name" href="/" aria-label="Enrique Gonzalez, home">
          Enrique Gonzalez
        </a>
        <a href={email}>
          Say hello <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </header>

      <main id="main">
        <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="hello">
          <h1 id="hello">Hi, I’m Enrique.</h1>
          <p>
            I work in support engineering. I like getting to the bottom of
            things—and helping a team do the same.
          </p>
          <p>
            Ten years in support, six in management. Most recently, I led a
            global support team at Sourcegraph.
          </p>
          <svg
            class="squiggle"
            width="112"
            height="44"
            viewBox="0 0 112 44"
            fill="none"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M3 31C20 17 39 4 40 18C41 25 31 40 46 35C64 29 86 12 108 3" />
          </svg>
        </section>

        <section class="sides" aria-label="A little more about how I work">
          <details>
            <summary>
              <span class="summary-title">
                The people side{" "}
                <span class="toggle-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
              <span class="summary-description">How I support a team.</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="detail-copy">
              <p>
                Good support is a team effort. My approach to leadership starts
                with listening, making room for questions, and helping people
                build confidence in their own judgment.
              </p>
              <p>
                Across time zones, clear context matters. A useful handoff helps
                the next person move forward without starting from scratch.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>
              <span class="summary-title">
                The technical side{" "}
                <span class="toggle-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
              <span class="summary-description">
                How I work through a problem.
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="detail-copy">
              <p>
                Start with what’s happening, who it affects, and what changed.
                Reproduce the behavior, question assumptions, and follow the
                evidence—not just the first plausible explanation.
              </p>
              <p>
                The explanation matters as much as the fix. Leave a clear trail
                so the customer and the next engineer can understand it, too.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>
        <nav aria-label="Find me elsewhere">
          <a href={email}>Email</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/egonzalezh94">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/enriquegh">GitHub</a>
        </nav>
        <p>Thanks for stopping by.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    color: #505a69;
    background: #faf9f6;
    font-synthesis: none;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    --ink: #25303d;
    --link: #3269ab;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--link);
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }
  a:focus-visible,
  summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--link);
    outline-offset: 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  ::selection {
    background: #dce8f5;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .page {
    width: min(100% - 96px, 760px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  header a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  header a:not(.name) span {
    margin-left: 5px;
  }
  .name {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  main {
    padding: 124px 32px 100px;
  }
  h1 {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 46px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -1.6px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  .intro p {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .squiggle {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 54px;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .squiggle path {
    stroke: #5084c2;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .sides {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 92px;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .summary-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    color: var(--link);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .toggle-mark::before {
    content: "+";
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .summary-description {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 9px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  details[open] .toggle-mark::before {
    content: "−";
  }
  .detail-copy {
    padding-top: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .detail-copy p {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #d6d9dc;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 28px 0 36px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  footer nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  footer p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .skip-link {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
    background: #faf9f6;
    transform: translateY(-200%);
  }
  .skip-link:focus {
    transform: none;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    a:hover {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    summary:hover .summary-title {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 5px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page {
      width: calc(100% - 48px);
    }
    header {
      padding-top: 28px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    main {
      padding: 88px 0 64px;
    }
    h1 {
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .intro p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .squiggle {
      margin-top: 38px;
      width: 96px;
    }
    .sides {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-top: 64px;
    }
    .summary-title {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .detail-copy {
      max-width: 38ch;
    }
    footer {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }
    footer nav {
      gap: 28px;
    }
    footer a {
      padding-block: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
